<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/51/eng@/~cl_115> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/51/eng@/~cl_115__para_c> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/51/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/51/eng@/~cl_115> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/51/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/51/eng@> .
