<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/51/eng@/~cl_11> <https://schema.org/text> "Section 48 of the principal Act is amended by inserting after subsection (2) the following subsection: “(3) A person who contravenes subsection (2) commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding five hundred thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding five years or to both.”. Amendment of section 51"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/51/eng@> .
