<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/51/eng@/~cl_46__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "by substituting for subsection (3) the following subsection: “(3) A licensee under this Part shall not provide any facility or service except in accordance with all the conditions of the individual licence granted to that licensee under this Part or all the conditions of a class licence to which the licensee is subject.”; and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/51/eng@> .
