<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/51/eng@/~cl_95__para_d> <https://schema.org/text> "in subsection (4), in the definition of “counterfeit access device”, by inserting after the words “a counterfeit access device” the words “, which includes any access device |that is primarily to assist in decoding an encrypted programme-carrying signal transmitted by any means without the authorization of the lawful distributor of such signal”. New section 236a"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/51/eng@> .
